// v16.xx (cardslot1), the HUD spec (2026-10-15, decision 5): THE GUN CARD STANDS IN THE RIGHT COLUMN. The card stands on the gear readout at
// the right edge, under the info panel, as the spec's card slot; it steps left of the column only when the panel above it reaches down
// to its top (a long contract list), which is the one case it cannot be in the column. v27.17 had always stepped it left, into the field.
B=HUDBOX.cond;
if(B&&B.w>0&&B.x>W*0.5){ if(yB-sz.h<B.y+B.h+Math.round(12*rs)) xR=Math.min(xR,B.x-Math.round(m*1.5)); }
else xR=Math.min(xR,W-Math.round(LH(190)*rs)-m);

